<article class="env-lemma" id="0FGA">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0FGA">Lemma <span data-tag="0FGA">45.4.1</span>.</a> The category $M_ k$ whose objects are motives over $k$ and morphisms are morphisms of motives over $k$ is a $\mathbf{Q}$-linear category. There is a contravariant functor </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  h : \{ \text{smooth projective schemes over }k\}  \longrightarrow M_ k  \]
</div>
  <p> defined by $h(X) = (X, 1, 0)$ and $h(f) = [\Gamma _ f]$. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
